{"4779500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doonbound", "steam_appid": 4779500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/d2b784f787a14349899bfd7ef8da6a37.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/d2b784f787a14349899bfd7ef8da6a37.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/d2b784f787a14349899bfd7ef8da6a37.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Adventure, Story, Battle, Creation... Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doonbound is a truly infinite MMORPG with real RPG Classes, PVE Dungeons, PVP Battlegrounds, Loot, Raids, and Quests. But here's the catch, everything is build in-game by the Community and played by everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/cb756b361f1b46965f5b32eb806c8dfe.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/cb756b361f1b46965f5b32eb806c8dfe.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/cb756b361f1b46965f5b32eb806c8dfe.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Editors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build everything in the game with in-game editors. Weapons, Armor, Assets, NPCs, Bosses, Music, Maps, Quests, Story, Loot Drops, PVP modes, Dungeons, Cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/401618d3e46df4fecc3f622926b393bd.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/401618d3e46df4fecc3f622926b393bd.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/401618d3e46df4fecc3f622926b393bd.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A Universe Built By Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build entire cities and worlds, and upload them for the community to play. Participate in Creation Tournaments with the community, with players voting on best assets, maps, music, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/90cb921fe2f6bc320f542fc451bead2e.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/90cb921fe2f6bc320f542fc451bead2e.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/90cb921fe2f6bc320f542fc451bead2e.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Classes (Warrior, Paladin, Hunter, Thief, Healer, Naturalist, Mage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Abilities and 6 Talents Per Class to Choose From</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite PVE Dungeons (5 Player) and PVP Battlegrounds (30 Player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization and Equipment Manager</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Editors (Weapons, Armor, Assets, NPCs, Bosses, Music, Maps, Quests, Loot Drops and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creation Database Where Players can Buy/Sell Creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voting System to Ensure Content Quality and Safety</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/d2b784f787a14349899bfd7ef8da6a37.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/d2b784f787a14349899bfd7ef8da6a37.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/d2b784f787a14349899bfd7ef8da6a37.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Adventure, Story, Battle, Creation... Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doonbound is a truly infinite MMORPG with real RPG Classes, PVE Dungeons, PVP Battlegrounds, Loot, Raids, and Quests. But here's the catch, everything is build in-game by the Community and played by everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/cb756b361f1b46965f5b32eb806c8dfe.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/cb756b361f1b46965f5b32eb806c8dfe.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/cb756b361f1b46965f5b32eb806c8dfe.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Editors</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build everything in the game with in-game editors. Weapons, Armor, Assets, NPCs, Bosses, Music, Maps, Quests, Story, Loot Drops, PVP modes, Dungeons, Cities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/401618d3e46df4fecc3f622926b393bd.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/401618d3e46df4fecc3f622926b393bd.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/401618d3e46df4fecc3f622926b393bd.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>A Universe Built By Players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build entire cities and worlds, and upload them for the community to play. Participate in Creation Tournaments with the community, with players voting on best assets, maps, music, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/90cb921fe2f6bc320f542fc451bead2e.poster.avif?t=1784039225\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/90cb921fe2f6bc320f542fc451bead2e.webm?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/extras/90cb921fe2f6bc320f542fc451bead2e.mp4?t=1784039225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Classes (Warrior, Paladin, Hunter, Thief, Healer, Naturalist, Mage)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 Abilities and 6 Talents Per Class to Choose From</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite PVE Dungeons (5 Player) and PVP Battlegrounds (30 Player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Loot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization and Equipment Manager</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Editors (Weapons, Armor, Assets, NPCs, Bosses, Music, Maps, Quests, Loot Drops and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creation Database Where Players can Buy/Sell Creations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voting System to Ensure Content Quality and Safety</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Doonbound is an MMORPG of endless adventure, battle, and creation, where everything is built by the Community.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/88f9f02fe2103b84f074c50dc7f032c1970ab1fd/header.jpg?t=1784039225", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/d536f381f35c3f4fd73a9e7b1cea22e484ac88a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784039225", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4779500/d536f381f35c3f4fd73a9e7b1cea22e484ac88a4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784039225", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 5th gen+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970+<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operat